  "limits": "The exploded view shrinks each projected cell toward its own projected centroid, which is a display choice, not a geometric operation in 4D. Sampling uses Python's random module with a fixed seed, so it is reproducible but not cryptographic. Under the stereographic projection, flat faces between projected vertices only approximate the curved images of the cells.",
